<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, I’m just too young to drive a car,</l><l>Build a bridge or take a rocket to a star.</l><l>But I’m not too young to thank the Lord.</l><l>I’m certainly not too young to thank the Lord.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
